# One of these is chosen (the Transformation's row asks).
group: perfect-traits
groupLabel: Perfect Traits
description: >
  Your strongest techniques pack a greater punch.
text: >
  Perfect Offense: Your strongest techniques pack a greater punch.
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Wound Rolls by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you use an Ultimate Signature Technique and spend 3+ Adaptation Points on the Wound Roll of that Attacking Maneuver, apply an Energy Charge to that Attacking Maneuver.

